    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/64a9e12ad4f8a0d212d8e65319ade92d.avif?t=1751975122\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a fantastical world where the oceans have been turned into vast living forests, Shuvani must traverse one of them to protect his family, taking on all manner of amalgamated creatures along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to defeat the waves of enemies, you can unlock powerful new abilities to use in the next fight before moving on to the next room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHUVANI\u2019S PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your abilities to the fullest and defeat all enemies standing in your way, for you will get only one chance to reach the heart of the forest and fulfill Shuvani's duty. As you overcome the ever-changing challenges this hostile environment presents, you will have the opportunity to add new skills to your toolkit, enabling you to surpass the enemies overwhelming power with your very own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/d981bbf878ed6405e0d53243dedab454.poster.avif?t=1751975122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/d981bbf878ed6405e0d53243dedab454.webm?t=1751975122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/d981bbf878ed6405e0d53243dedab454.mp4?t=1751975122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERSONALIZE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different types of magics: arcane, astral and totemic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon equippable artifacts with permanent upgrades, and permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be creative! Combine different magics and abilities to create powerful combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different approaches and develop effective strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scalable difficulty and a thrilling final battle </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/2d03f517c3ee53ec91ab2db32fb773b6.poster.avif?t=1751975122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/2d03f517c3ee53ec91ab2db32fb773b6.webm?t=1751975122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/2d03f517c3ee53ec91ab2db32fb773b6.mp4?t=1751975122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEEK THE RELIC AND BREAK THE CYCLE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and confront the creature that has stolen your only way out of the forest. Discover why it attacked you and unveil a fearsome final plan.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/64a9e12ad4f8a0d212d8e65319ade92d.avif?t=1751975122\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a fantastical world where the oceans have been turned into vast living forests, Shuvani must traverse one of them to protect his family, taking on all manner of amalgamated creatures along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to defeat the waves of enemies, you can unlock powerful new abilities to use in the next fight before moving on to the next room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHUVANI\u2019S PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your abilities to the fullest and defeat all enemies standing in your way, for you will get only one chance to reach the heart of the forest and fulfill Shuvani's duty. As you overcome the ever-changing challenges this hostile environment presents, you will have the opportunity to add new skills to your toolkit, enabling you to surpass the enemies overwhelming power with your very own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/d981bbf878ed6405e0d53243dedab454.poster.avif?t=1751975122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/d981bbf878ed6405e0d53243dedab454.webm?t=1751975122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/d981bbf878ed6405e0d53243dedab454.mp4?t=1751975122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERSONALIZE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different types of magics: arcane, astral and totemic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon equippable artifacts with permanent upgrades, and permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be creative! Combine different magics and abilities to create powerful combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different approaches and develop effective strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scalable difficulty and a thrilling final battle </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/2d03f517c3ee53ec91ab2db32fb773b6.poster.avif?t=1751975122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/2d03f517c3ee53ec91ab2db32fb773b6.webm?t=1751975122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378400/extras/2d03f517c3ee53ec91ab2db32fb773b6.mp4?t=1751975122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEEK THE RELIC AND BREAK THE CYCLE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and confront the creature that has stolen your only way out of the forest. Discover why it attacked you and unveil a fearsome final plan.</p>",
